Feature: PetStore API CRUD Operations\n\nBackground:\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n\nScenario: Create a new pet\n    When I send a POST request with the following data:\n        | id | name   | status    |\n        | 1  | Fluffy | available |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n\nScenario: Get pet by ID\n    When I send a GET request for pet with ID 1\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the pet name should be \"Fluffy\"\n\nScenario: Update pet status\n    When I send a PUT request to update pet with ID 1 to status \"sold\"\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the pet status should be \"sold\"\n\nScenario: Delete pet\n    When I send a DELETE request for pet with ID 1\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n\nScenario: Get non-existent pet\n    When I send a GET request for pet with ID 9999\n    Then the response status code should be 404\n\nScenario: Create pet with invalid data\n    When I send a POST request with the following data:\n        | id | name | status |\n        | abc | 123 | xyz |\n    Then the response status code should be 400